# No Higgsfield during development

While coding, debugging, or verifying a change, do not call the Higgsfield API. That includes image generation, video generation, status polls, and any script that submits a job.

Verify with local unit tests, prompt snapshots, and mocks. A test file under `src/service/higgsfield/` that only checks prompt text or pure functions is fine. A live submit is not.

Do not use a real video or frame regeneration on Higgsfield to check that a code change works.
